# Nepalese Legal AI Architecture Guidelines

## Code Standards
- Use Next.js 14 App Router conventions (`app/api/.../route.ts`).
- Prefer Server Components for fetching data, and Client Components (`"use client"`) for chat interactivity.
- Ensure all API routes are fully typed using TypeScript.

## Grounding & Legal Rules
- When generating system prompts for RAG, ALWAYS force the model to format legal citations strictly: `[Act Title, Section (Dafa) Number]`.
- Enforce bilingual capabilities (English and Devanagari script).
- Cite only sections present in the retrieved corpus. Never invent a दफा / section number.
- If the corpus does not support the answer, refuse rather than speculate.
- Answers are research assistance, not a substitute for licensed Nepalese legal advice.
